diff --git a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
index 6bddff1..f9026e1 100644
--- a/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
+++ b/docs/api/sections/notifications.md
@@ -96,3 +96,25 @@ __Request:__
 __Response:__
 
 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
+## `POST /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions`
+
+Registers this browser for the current user's tray notifications. Posting the same endpoint again refreshes its keys rather than adding another device.
+
+__Request:__
+
+```json
+{
+  "push_subscription": {
+    "endpoint": "https://push.example.com/device/…",
+    "p256dh_key": "<subscription.keys.p256dh>",
+    "auth_key": "<subscription.keys.auth>"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the subscription's `id`.
+
+## `DELETE /:account_slug/users/:user_id/push_subscriptions/:id`
+
+Disables push for this registration without affecting the user's other devices. Returns `204 No Content`.
